        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ToneTrek</strong> is a colorful and clever logic puzzle game where every step reshapes the board.<br>Your mission: walk across a grid of tiles, change their colors in a looping sequence, and recreate a target pattern — all in as few moves as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With minimalist visuals, relaxing sound design, and gameplay that ranges from chill to brain-bending, <i>ToneTrek</i> is perfect for puzzle fans who enjoy planning, experimenting, and finding the most efficient path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing a quick level or diving into the full campaign, every puzzle is handcrafted to challenge your logic and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851630/extras/fbb5bb69a7f82fe66ad8373a865bbf69.avif?t=1767372917\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Grid-Based Logic Gameplay</strong> – Each step cycles a tile’s color; plan your route carefully to match the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> – Campaign, single-level, move limit, time limit, and free play options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Customizable Visuals</strong> – Choose from a variety of color palettes and tile styles to suit your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Score Attack</strong> – Beat your own move/time records and unlock harder challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Multilingual Support</strong> – English, Español, Deutsch, and Magyar at launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>100 Handcrafted Levels</strong> – From simple geometric patterns to complex pixel-art shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Replay-Friendly Design</strong> – Try different strategies, improve your path, or just relax and color your way through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🆘 <strong>Built-In Tutorial</strong> – Learn the rules step by step with accessible onboarding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ToneTrek is simple to pick up but offers deep satisfaction for players who enjoy puzzles that reward clever thinking and precision planning.</i></p>",
